This folder contains the ethernet BFM receiver rtl and classes.
The rtl directory contains the ethernet bfm generator top level, packages and
interfaces.
The env directory contains the packet, axi streaming packet monitor and checker
classes. The monitor can be replaced if a different dut interface is required.

The packet class contained in eth_packet.sv provides packet generator 
programmability of various ethernet level and ip level fields as well as
packet length. It also extracts and prints header fields for the packet receiver.


